# Gitignored files copied into a fresh worktree from the primary checkout.
#
# Consumed by `npm run worktree:init` — see scripts/worktree-init.sh.
# Run it after manual `git worktree add`; Cursor also calls it through
# .cursor/worktrees.json.
#
# This is an ALLOWLIST, not a blanket copy: node_modules is intentionally absent
# (worktree:init runs `npm ci` for a real install — never a symlink). The dev server
# reads VITE_WEBSOCKET_URL from .env.local (see scripts/dev-server.sh). Paths are
# globbed against the primary checkout; zero matches are tolerated. Copied, never
# symlinked (a symlinked .env.local resolves outside the worktree and trips Vite's
# server.fs.allow).
.env.local
.env.*.local
